<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="hr_field_timesheet_list_view_form" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">hr.field.timesheet.list.form</field>
        <field name="model">hr.field.timesheet.list</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <form string="Lista de horas">
                <header>
                    <button name="action_generate" type="object" string="Generar lista" class="btn-primary"
                            invisible="line_ids"/>
                    <button name="action_generate" type="object" string="Volver a generar" invisible="not line_ids"/>
                    <button name="action_export_excel" type="object" string="Descargar Excel" class="btn-primary"
                            invisible="not line_ids"/>
                    <button name="action_back_to_draft" type="object" string="Regresar a borrador"
                            invisible="state != 'exported'"/>
                    <field name="state" widget="statusbar"/>
                </header>
                <sheet>
                    <div class="oe_title">
                        <h1><field name="name"/></h1>
                    </div>
                    <group>
                        <group>
                            <field name="date_from" readonly="state == 'exported'"/>
                            <field name="date_to" readonly="state == 'exported'"/>
                            <field name="supervisor_id" options="{'no_create': True}" readonly="state == 'exported'"/>
                            <field name="project_id" options="{'no_create': True}" readonly="state == 'exported'"/>
                        </group>
                        <group>
                            <field name="line_count"/>
                            <field name="total_hours" widget="float_time"/>
                            <field name="excel_name" invisible="1"/>
                            <field name="excel_file" filename="excel_name" invisible="not excel_file"/>
                            <field name="exported_by_id" invisible="not exported_by_id"/>
                            <field name="exported_on" invisible="not exported_on"/>
                        </group>
                    </group>
                    <div class="text-muted mb-2">
                        Solo entran asistencias válidas o aprobadas, con salida. La hoja «Hojas de horas» del Excel tiene las
                        columnas de la importación de Proyectos › Hojas de horas; la hoja «Detalle» trae entradas, salidas y supervisor.
                    </div>
                    <field name="line_ids" readonly="state == 'exported'">
                        <list editable="bottom">
                            <field name="date"/>
                            <field name="employee_key" optional="show"/>
                            <field name="employee_id" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="supervisor_id" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="project_id" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="hours" widget="float_time" sum="Horas"/>
                            <field name="overtime_hours" widget="float_time" sum="Extra" optional="show"/>
                        </list>
                    </field>
                </sheet>
                <chatter/>
            </form>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="hr_field_timesheet_list_view_list" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">hr.field.timesheet.list.list</field>
        <field name="model">hr.field.timesheet.list</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <list string="Listas de horas">
                <field name="name"/>
                <field name="date_from"/>
                <field name="date_to"/>
                <field name="supervisor_id" optional="show"/>
                <field name="project_id" optional="show"/>
                <field name="line_count"/>
                <field name="total_hours" widget="float_time"/>
                <field name="create_uid" string="Creada por" optional="show"/>
                <field name="exported_on" optional="show"/>
                <field name="state" widget="badge" decoration-success="state == 'exported'" decoration-info="state == 'draft'"/>
            </list>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="hr_field_timesheet_list_action" model="ir.actions.act_window">
        <field name="name">Listas de horas</field>
        <field name="res_model">hr.field.timesheet.list</field>
        <field name="view_mode">list,form</field>
        <field name="help" type="html">
            <p class="o_view_nocontent_smiling_face">Crea tu primera lista de horas</p>
            <p>Elige el periodo, y si quieres un supervisor o una obra; Odoo arma la lista con las asistencias aceptadas
               y la descargas en Excel para importarla en las hojas de horas. Cada lista queda guardada aquí.</p>
        </field>
    </record>
</odoo>
